{"id":"a1a1dc70da0d9f61","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-recursive-determinacy-game.md","title":"ZFC Recursive Determinacy Game","display":"df-zfc-recursive-determinacy-game — ZFC Recursive Determinacy Game","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursive-determinacy-game","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursive-determinacy-game"],"display":"df-zfc-recursive-determinacy-game — ZFC Recursive Determinacy Game","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursive-determinacy-game"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursive-determinacy-game</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursive-determinacy-game — ZFC Recursive Determinacy Game"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"61744098b3a465ad\" href=\"?note=61744098b3a465ad\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"da76983f71a491b6\" href=\"?note=da76983f71a491b6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_A,A,\\sigma,\\tau,x,n\\in V\">\\(G_A,A,\\sigma,\\tau,x,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GameTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{GameTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"61744098b3a465ad\" href=\"?note=61744098b3a465ad\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree.md\">../batch06/58-df-zfc-game-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"da76983f71a491b6\" href=\"?note=da76983f71a491b6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-recursive-payoff-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveDeterminacyGame}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveDeterminacyGame}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}game} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveDeterminacyGame}_S(G_A,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nG_A=\\langle\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{GameTree}_S(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S(A,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega})\n\\land\\Biggl[\n\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\sigma,\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega^{2n},\\omega\\right)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x(2n)=\\sigma(x\\upharpoonright2n))\\to x\\in A\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\lor\n\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\tau,\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega^{2n+1},\\omega\\right)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x(2n+1)=\\tau(x\\upharpoonright(2n+1)))\\to x\\notin A\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}determinacy\\text{-}game} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcRecursiveDeterminacyGame}_S(G_A,A)\n\\leftrightarrow\nG_A=\\langle\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{GameTree}_S(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcRecursivePayoffSet}_S(A,\\omega^{&lt;\\omega})\n\\land\\Biggl[\n\\exists\\sigma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\sigma,\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega^{2n},\\omega\\right)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x(2n)=\\sigma(x\\upharpoonright2n))\\to x\\in A\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\lor\n\\exists\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\tau,\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\omega^{2n+1},\\omega\\right)\n\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\n\\bigl(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x(2n+1)=\\tau(x\\upharpoonright(2n+1)))\\to x\\notin A\\bigr)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The final disjunction explicitly states that Player I or Player II has a winning strategy.</li>\n<li>The game tree and the recursive payoff predicate share the same Baire-space play carrier.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-